{"unit_id":"ShallBay__dsh-bridge-browser#card-zh","repo":"ShallBay/dsh-bridge-browser","commit":"558248bb10cf3a216ca159c4fefcaf61df09d695","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Browser Bridge 是面向 DSH Web 和 Desktop 的浏览器桥接插件：它把 Chrome 扩展连接到 DSH，并注册一组 browser_* 工具。模型可以读取当前网页和可访问的 iframe 文本快照，按编号点击页面元素、填写表单、发送按键、滚动或导航；也能列出、切换和关闭标签页，并等待页面稳定。用户可在已有浏览器登录态下让 DSH 完成网页信息查看与交互。使用时需要安装并加载随包提供的浏览器扩展；桥接令牌可通过环境变量固定，否则由插件生成。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:230-253","src/tools.ts:115-199","src/tools.ts:201-318","cordis.patch.yml:34"]}
{"unit_id":"ShallBay__dsh-bridge-browser#card-en","repo":"ShallBay/dsh-bridge-browser","commit":"558248bb10cf3a216ca159c4fefcaf61df09d695","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Browser Bridge connects a Chrome extension to DSH and adds browser tools. It lets the model read page snapshots, click elements, fill forms, navigate, manage tabs, and wait for pages to settle. Install and load the included extension; a fixed bridge token is optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:230-253","src/tools.ts:115-199","src/tools.ts:201-318","cordis.patch.yml:34"]}
